<title>POLAND: WOLCZANKA MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>WOLCZANKA MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.61 vs   0.64</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.09 vs   1.21</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.91 vs   1.19</p>
<p> Sales		    9.04 vs   8.07</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.87 vs   2.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.25 vs   4.93</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.68 vs   4.13</p>
<p> Sales		   41.48 vs  38.04</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Wolczanka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
